具体来源如下，按被借鉴的部分列出。

--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
1. 界面与合议逻辑：TomaszRewak/MAGI
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
    https://github.com/TomaszRewak/MAGI
    Copyright (c) 2023 Tomasz Rewak        MIT License

    "MAGI system is a cluster of three AI supercomputers that manage and
     support all task performed by the NERV organization from their
     Tokyo-3 headquarter."

    取自该项目的内容（逐值照抄，非主观近似）：

      · 三个贤人块的裁形多边形
            MELCHIOR  polygon(35% 0, 100% 0, 100% 100%, 0 100%, 0 44%)
            BALTHASAR polygon(0 0, 100% 0, 100% 80%, 75% 100%, 25% 100%, 0 80%)
            CASPER    polygon(0 0, 65% 0, 100% 44%, 100% 100%, 0 100%)
      · 三根连接杆的旋转角 −54° / 0° / +54°
      · 配色表 #ff8d00 / #140b02 / #277547 / #52e691 / #a41413 / #3caee0 / #82cd68
      · 闪烁动效（0.25s step-end 无限循环）
      · 五个结论的判定顺序与各自配色（誤差 → 情報 → 拒絶 → 状態 → 合意）
      · 面板网格比例、状态读数文案、頁眉「質 問 / 解 決」与标题「MAGI」
      · 三段出厂人格
            MELCHIOR • 1  "You are a scientist. …"
            BALTHASAR • 2 "You are a mother. …"
            CASPER • 3    "You are a woman. …"

